(56, 'Kai\'Sa', 'Claimed by the Void when she was only a child, Kai\'Sa managed to survive through sheer tenacity and strength of will. Her experiences have made her a deadly hunter and, to some, the harbinger of a future they would rather not live to see. Having entered...', 640, 345, 3.5, 8.2, 335, 30, 25, 525, 0, 59, 0.644, );
