(60, 'Kassadin', 'Cutting a burning swath through the darkest places of the world, Kassadin knows his days are numbered. A widely traveled Shuriman guide and adventurer, he had chosen to raise a family among the peaceful southern tribes—until the day his village was...', 646, 400, 6, 6, 335, 30, 19, 150, 0, 59, 0.64, );
