(61, 'Katarina', 'Decisive in judgment and lethal in combat, Katarina is a Noxian assassin of the highest caliber. Eldest daughter to the legendary General Du Couteau, she made her talents known with swift kills against unsuspecting enemies. Her fiery ambition has driven...', 672, 0, 7.5, 0, 335, 32, 28, 125, 0, 58, 0.658, );
