(64, 'Kennen', 'More than just the lightning-quick enforcer of Ionian balance, Kennen is the only yordle member of the Kinkou. Despite his small, furry stature, he is eager to take on any threat with a whirling storm of shuriken and boundless enthusiasm. Alongside his...', 580, 200, 5.5, 50, 335, 30, 29, 550, 0, 48, 0.625, );
