(66, 'Kindred', 'Separate, but never parted, Kindred represents the twin essences of death. Lamb\'s bow offers a swift release from the mortal realm for those who accept their fate. Wolf hunts down those who run from their end, delivering violent finality within his...', 595, 300, 7, 7, 325, 30, 29, 500, 0, 65, 0.625, );
