(67, 'Kled', 'A warrior as fearless as he is ornery, the yordle Kled embodies the furious bravado of Noxus. He is an icon beloved by the empire\'s soldiers, distrusted by its officers, and loathed by the nobility. Many claim Kled has fought in every campaign the...', 410, 100, 6, 0, 345, 28, 35, 125, 0, 65, 0.625, );
