(68, 'Kog\'Maw', 'Belched forth from a rotting Void incursion deep in the wastelands of Icathia, Kog\'Maw is an inquisitive yet putrid creature with a caustic, gaping mouth. This particular Void-spawn needs to gnaw and drool on anything within reach to truly understand it...', 635, 325, 3.75, 8.75, 330, 30, 24, 500, 0, 61, 0.665, );
