(69, 'K\'Sante', 'Defiant and courageous, K\'Sante battles colossal beasts and ruthless Ascended to protect his home of Nazumah, a coveted oasis amid the sands of Shurima. But after a falling-out with his former partner, K\'Sante realizes that in order to become a warrior...', 625, 320, 9.5, 7, 330, 30, 36, 150, 0, 64, 0.688, );
