(70, 'LeBlanc', 'Mysterious even to other members of the Black Rose cabal, LeBlanc is but one of many names for a pale woman who has manipulated people and events since the earliest days of Noxus. Using her magic to mirror herself, the sorceress can appear to anyone...', 598, 400, 7.5, 8, 340, 30, 22, 525, 0, 55, 0.658, );
