(74, 'Lissandra', 'Lissandra\'s magic twists the pure power of ice into something dark and terrible. With the force of her black ice, she does more than freeze—she impales and crushes those who oppose her. To the terrified denizens of the north, she is known only as \'\'The...', 620, 475, 7, 8, 325, 30, 22, 550, 0, 55, 0.656, );
