(109, 'Renekton', 'Renekton is a terrifying, rage-fueled Ascended being from the scorched deserts of Shurima. Once, he was his empire\'s most esteemed warrior, leading the nation\'s armies to countless victories. However, after the empire\'s fall, Renekton was entombed...', 660, 100, 8, 0, 345, 28, 35, 125, 0, 69, 0.665, );
