(147, 'Veigar', 'An enthusiastic master of dark sorcery, Veigar has embraced powers that few mortals dare approach. As a free-spirited inhabitant of Bandle City, he longed to push beyond the limitations of yordle magic, and turned instead to arcane texts that had been...', 580, 490, 6.5, 8, 340, 32, 18, 550, 0, 52, 0.625, );
